# {{ agents.store_name }} - Apple Microelectronics Repair Specialists (London & UK)

> Independent Apple repair workshop in Fitzrovia, Central London (never outsourced), with same-day London courier collection in selected zones and free tracked, insured UK mail-in on orders £200+. Specialists in MacBook liquid damage recovery, dead / no-power logic board micro-soldering, genuine Apple MacBook panel-only screen repair, and same-day iPhone screen repairs.

## Core Specialties

- **MacBook Liquid Damage Recovery:** Ultrasonic logic board cleaning, 40x stereo microscope inspection, and component-level micro-soldering that preserves the original logic board and soldered SSD data wherever possible.
- **Dead & No-Power MacBook Repair:** USB-C ammeter and schematic rail tracing (`CD3217`, `PPBUS_G3H`, PMIC phases) to replace single failed micro-components instead of an Apple full logic board swap.
- **MacBook Screen Repair (Panel Only):** Genuine Apple display panels fitted into the original aluminium lid, camera, and hinges, calibrated in-house at 30% to 50% less than a full-lid replacement.
- **Same-Day iPhone Screen Repairs:** Same-day iPhone screen replacement using genuine Apple displays, plus battery, charging port, camera, Face ID, and component-level logic board repairs.
- **iPad & Apple Watch Repairs:** Calibrated iPad Pro, Air, and Mini screen/glass and battery repairs, plus Apple Watch glass-only screen restoration and battery replacement.
- **Corporate Apple Repair Accounts:** Priority turnaround and tracked London collection for studios, agencies, and businesses.

## Turnaround & Express Options

- **iPhone Screen Repairs:** Same-day service available in Fitzrovia (plus tracked London courier and UK mail-in).
- **MacBook Repairs:** Standard 2 to 3 working days once the MacBook reaches our workshop; express options available when pre-booked (subject to workshop capacity).
- **Logic Board & Liquid Damage Diagnostics:** Written microscope fault report and fixed repair quote emailed within 1 working day of arrival. Zero deposits; nothing proceeds without approval.

